{
  "name": "Automatically send NDAs from form submissions",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automatically send NDAs from form submissions\n\nThis workflow sends an NDA through VisiSign after a form submission, replies to the form immediately, and emails the signed PDF back when VisiSign reports completion.\n\n### Tested path\n1. Send the sample form payload below to the **Form Submitted** test URL.\n2. Confirm **Send NDA via VisiSign** creates a signature request.\n3. Complete the signature request in VisiSign.\n4. Confirm the trigger downloads the signed file and passes it to the email node.\n\n### Required setup\n- Install `n8n-nodes-visisign`.\n- Add VisiSign API credentials.\n- Add SMTP/email credentials for the email node.\n- Configure your form tool to send `name`, `email`, and `nda_pdf_url`.\n\n### Sample test payload\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Abigail Kaster\",\n  \"email\": \"abbykaster@example.com\",\n  \"nda_pdf_url\": \"https://api.visisign.app/samples/visisign-test-agreement.pdf\",\n  \"sender_email\": \"legal@example.com\"\n}\n```",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Overview and setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Form submission\n\nConnect Typeform, Tally, Webflow, or any form tool that can POST JSON to this webhook. The workflow only needs the signer name, signer email, and a PDF URL for the NDA.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Form submission payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Signed copy\n\nThe VisiSign completion trigger downloads the completed PDF and attaches it to the email sent back to the signer.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Signed NDA delivery",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "nda-request",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Form Submitted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        300,
        280
      ],
      "webhookId": "nda-request"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "signatureRequest",
        "operation": "create",
        "title": "={{ 'Non-Disclosure Agreement — ' + $json.name }}",
        "fileUrl": "={{ $json.nda_pdf_url }}",
        "signers": {
          "signer": [
            {
              "name": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "email": "={{ $json.email }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "message": "={{ 'Hi ' + $json.name + ',\\n\\nPlease review and sign the NDA to proceed. This should only take a minute.' }}",
        "metadata": "={{ { sender_email: $json.sender_email } }}"
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Send NDA via VisiSign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-visisign.visiSign",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        280
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "visiSignApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "VisiSign API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ success: true, message: 'NDA sent — check your email.' }) }}"
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Respond to Form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        780,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "signature_request.completed"
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "NDA Signed Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-visisign.visiSignTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        540
      ],
      "webhookId": "visisign-signed",
      "credentials": {
        "visiSignApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "VisiSign API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "signatureRequest",
        "operation": "downloadFile",
        "requestId": "={{ $json.signature_request.id }}"
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Download Signed NDA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-visisign.visiSign",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        540
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "visiSignApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "VisiSign API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $(\"NDA Signed Trigger\").item.json.signature_request.metadata.sender_email || \"legal@example.com\" }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('NDA Signed Trigger').item.json.signature_request.signers[0].email }}",
        "subject": "Your signed NDA is attached",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ 'Hi ' + $('NDA Signed Trigger').item.json.signature_request.signers[0].name + ',\\n\\nThank you for signing the NDA. Your signed copy is attached for your records.\\n\\nBest,\\nThe Team' }}",
        "options": {
          "attachments": "data"
        }
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Email Signed Copy to Signer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        780,
        540
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Form Submitted": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send NDA via VisiSign",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send NDA via VisiSign": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond to Form",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "NDA Signed Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download Signed NDA",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download Signed NDA": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email Signed Copy to Signer",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
